#58500
"Entrance to the Canopy"
"You find yourself looking around a vast clearing, totally encased by the
forest.  Dense foliage weaves itself into a mesh of life, obstructing all
outside hindrances.  Not even the brightness of the sun can break through the
tree line.  Rocks of mass size hinder your movement deeper into the clearing.
A wall of trees and shrubs lay to the west stopping your progress out of the
canopy.  The clearing is vast and most of it is lush and green.  Smoke rises
from the far east of the clearing and makes its way to the center of the
canopy to the only hole in the tree line.
"
""
