#58507
"Center of the Canopy"
"The intertwining limbs and branches seem to halt above you, creating a hole
large enough for any creature to enter or exit by flight.  The plumes of smoke
from around the clearing funnel themselves to this area and escape via the
hole in the canopy.  The trail splits here allowing access from any
direction.  Darkness and smoke loom to the west, as the foliage thickens
creating a tunnel.  The north and eastern sides of the clearing are lined with
eggs.  Under your feet traces of ash cover the ground like a fine powder.
"
